Wanna spend time playing the new
"Star Wars" game this weekend?

2
00:00:06,506 --> 00:00:09,506
Mm, I don't know,
l promised myseIf l'd get off the computer...

3
00:00:09,676 --> 00:00:12,346
(Leonard:)...be more physically active,
get some exercise.

4
