when the neighbors called the cops on us.

11
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:44,914
(Howard:)They called the cops because of the smell.
They thought we were dead.

12
00:00:47,130 --> 00:00:49,630
(Raj:)We were bad-ass back in the day.

13
00:00:51,968 --> 00:00:55,218
- All right, let's do it.
- Forty-eight hours of "Star wars" gaming.

14
00:00:55,388 --> 00:00:57,348
(Raj:)It's on like Alderaan.

15
